{
  "server": "cn",
  "storyId": "act14side_level_act14side_07_end",
  "groupId": "act14side",
  "stageId": "act14side_07",
  "title": "破冰",
  "storyCode": "BI-7",
  "avgTag": "行动后",
  "sourcePath": "vendor/ArknightsData/cn/gamedata/story/activities/act14side/level_act14side_07_end.txt",
  "sourceHash": "000c52b93d799f1914acf9e62d71c49db3c3563a5fdd279cea7a6ae9606b9fc0",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "level_act14side_07_end"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "恩希亚",
      "speakerToken": "avgnew_173_slchan_1#8$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......切斯特叔叔，为什么我不能出去？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "切斯特",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_267_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "总裁吩咐了，在他回来之前，不允许你四处跑。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "恩希亚",
      "speakerToken": "avgnew_173_slchan_1#7$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "那老哥什么时候回来？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "切斯特",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_267_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "总裁现在应当正在前往圣山的路上，过两天就能回来了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "恩希亚",
      "speakerToken": "avgnew_173_slchan_1#8$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我只是想去散步也不行吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "切斯特",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_267_1#2$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "只是在宅子附近的话......我会派人跟着你。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "切斯特",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_267_1#2$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "恩希亚，现在谢拉格的形势十分险峻，这也是为了你好。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "恩希亚",
      "speakerToken": "avgnew_173_slchan_1#7$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......唉。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "恩希亚",
      "speakerToken": "avgnew_173_slchan_1#8$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "老哥......你就一定要这么做吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "恩希亚",
      "speakerToken": "avgnew_173_slchan_1#7$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "博士，我该怎么办......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "恩希亚",
      "speakerToken": "avgnew_173_slchan_1#3$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "极光？！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "极光",
      "speakerToken": "avg_422_aurora_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "嘘——好严密的守备，我好不容易才进来的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "恩希亚",
      "speakerToken": "avgnew_173_slchan_1#3$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你不是和Sharp队长一起去博士那边了吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "极光",
      "speakerToken": "avg_422_aurora_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "嗯，我这次来，就是博士有话要我带给你。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "诺希斯",
      "speakerToken": "avg_206_gnosis_1#4$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你确定？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莫希",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_255_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "是的，阿克托斯在领地内集结了大量士兵，但是，这支队伍的领导者是那位博士，而不是阿克托斯。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "诺希斯",
      "speakerToken": "avg_206_gnosis_1#7$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "阿克托斯人呢？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莫希",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_255_1#6$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "不清楚......根据眼线的回报，在将这支队伍的指挥权正式交给博士后，他就不知所踪了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "诺希斯",
      "speakerToken": "avg_206_gnosis_1#7$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......那个博士的队伍是诱饵？不，不会这么简单。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "诺希斯",
      "speakerToken": "avg_206_gnosis_1#7$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "规模呢？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莫希",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_255_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "佩尔罗契领地响应阿克托斯号召的家族和您想象的差不多，以此估算的话——阿克托斯应该不可能再集结起另外一支同样规模的队伍。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "诺希斯",
      "speakerToken": "avg_206_gnosis_1#2$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "但是他不可能待在后方，有另一支队伍的可能性很大。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莫希",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_255_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "佩尔罗契家的战士本来就很擅长在山野中行动，这确实不是没有可能。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "诺希斯",
      "speakerToken": "avg_206_gnosis_1#7$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "但是，无论是诱饵还是主力，这支队伍都不能放任不理。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "诺希斯",
      "speakerToken": "avg_206_gnosis_1#7$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "让魏斯传令，命战士们在山下集结，等候命令。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "诺希斯",
      "speakerToken": "avg_206_gnosis_1#7$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "然后派人去盯着大部队，你主要负责去找出阿克托斯的踪迹。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莫希",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_255_1#6$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "是。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "恩希亚",
      "speakerToken": "avgnew_173_slchan_1#3$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "博士......希望我能登上圣山，潜入蔓珠院去找姐姐？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "极光",
      "speakerToken": "avg_422_aurora_1#5$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "是的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "极光",
      "speakerToken": "avg_422_aurora_1#5$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "博士的意思是，如今，佩尔罗契家和希瓦艾什家之间的冲突已经几乎无法避免了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "极光",
      "speakerToken": "avg_422_aurora_1#5$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "但是，如果说还有一个人可以阻止这一切的话，那么，这个人必然是你的姐姐，当代圣女，恩雅·希瓦艾什。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "恩希亚",
      "speakerToken": "avgnew_173_slchan_1#7$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "但是......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "极光",
      "speakerToken": "avg_422_aurora_1#4$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "原本，博士是想秉承罗德岛不干政的方针，选择袖手旁观的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "极光",
      "speakerToken": "avg_422_aurora_1#4$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "但是，博士指出一点，既然还政对于恩希欧迪斯先生来说只是一个幌子，那么他也必然不会将对谢拉格的信仰放在眼中。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "极光",
      "speakerToken": "avg_422_aurora_1#4$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "而一旦希瓦艾什家的部队真的击败了佩尔罗契家的部队，那么对他来说，阻拦他将谢拉格纳入囊中的，也就只有蔓珠院。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "极光",
      "speakerToken": "avg_422_aurora_1#4$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "也就是谢拉格人民的信仰对象，圣女。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "极光",
      "speakerToken": "avg_422_aurora_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "博士说，他并不是想要让你去说服圣女做些什么，而是你曾经拜托过他，希望他能够帮忙缓和你们兄妹之间关系。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "极光",
      "speakerToken": "avg_422_aurora_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "他对于自己来到谢拉格后没有帮上忙一直感到有些自责。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "恩希亚",
      "speakerToken": "avgnew_173_slchan_1#8$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "这怎么能怪博士！我才要对博士和随行的各位道歉，明明应该是一次愉快的旅行，结果却因为老哥而变成了这个样子......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "极光",
      "speakerToken": "avg_422_aurora_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "这也不怪你呀，崖心。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "极光",
      "speakerToken": "avg_422_aurora_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "总之，博士的意思是，他可以不在乎很多东西，但一方面他从一开始就被恩希欧迪斯先生卷了进来。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "极光",
      "speakerToken": "avg_422_aurora_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "另一方面，你是恩希欧迪斯先生的妹妹也是不争的事实。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "极光",
      "speakerToken": "avg_422_aurora_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "所以，博士还是打算做一些什么。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "极光",
      "speakerToken": "avg_422_aurora_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "让你上山，是希望你能成为圣女身边的保险。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "恩希亚",
      "speakerToken": "avgnew_173_slchan_1#8$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "博士希望我在必要的时候去阻止老哥。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "极光",
      "speakerToken": "avg_422_aurora_1#5$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "或者在必要的时候带着圣女逃跑。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "恩希亚",
      "speakerToken": "avgnew_173_slchan_1#8$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "恩希亚下意识地摸了摸自己手中的绳环。\n这是小时候，姐姐亲手为她编织的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "恩希亚",
      "speakerToken": "avgnew_173_slchan_1#2$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "恩希亚",
      "speakerToken": "avgnew_173_slchan_1#8$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我去。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "极光",
      "speakerToken": "avg_422_aurora_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "这是一次潜入行动，我和其他的随行干员会一起协助你。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "恩希亚",
      "speakerToken": "avgnew_173_slchan_1#8$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......不。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "恩希亚",
      "speakerToken": "avgnew_173_slchan_1#8$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我有更好的办法。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "恩希亚",
      "speakerToken": "avgnew_173_slchan_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "大家只要能帮我到达圣山脚下就好，剩下的，交给我一个人。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "古罗",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_260_1#3$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "博士，为什么你要把行军的速度控制得这么慢？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "要让观察着我们的眼睛再多欣赏欣赏。",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        },
        {
          "label": "现在还不能快。",
          "value": "2",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": [
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "休露丝",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_262_1#1$1",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "我说，古罗你该不会还没搞清楚我们要干什么吧？"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "古罗",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_260_1#1$1",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "不就是吸引希瓦艾什家的注意吗？我就是觉得有点太慢了。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "休露丝",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_262_1#2$1",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "我看你就是想直接冲过去和希瓦艾什家打一仗。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "古罗",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_260_1#2$1",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "那当然。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "古罗",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_260_1#2$1",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "之前被瓦莱丝压了一头，我现在胸口憋着一口气呢。"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "佩尔罗契家战士",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_284_1$1",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "博士，在大典上被抓走的尤卡坦的位置确认了。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "佩尔罗契家战士",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_284_1$1",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "和您想的一样，没有被带回希瓦艾什家的领地，而是就近关在了山脚下的镇子里。"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "辛苦了。",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": [
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "古罗",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_260_1#4$1",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "博士，你可真厉害啊，这么短的时间里就能摸清楚尤卡坦老爷被关押的位置。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "休露丝",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_262_1#2$1",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "哼，这点情报收集，我布朗陶家的人也做得到。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "休露丝",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_262_1#3$1",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "总之，既然确认了尤卡坦的位置，我和这个傻大个也该动起来了吧？"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "是的。",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": [
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "古罗",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_260_1#5$1",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "......"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "休露丝",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_262_1#10$1",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "你沉默什么？"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "古罗",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_260_1#6$1",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "什么，原来你在喊我吗？我可不是傻大个！"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "休露丝",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_262_1#7$1",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "（深呼吸）"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "休露丝",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_262_1#8$1",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "古罗！将军！哼......这样就行了吧？"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "休露丝",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_262_1#8$1",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "我问你，你知道你要做什么吧？"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "古罗",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_260_1#4$1",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "我知道，去最近的车站搞点破坏，让你有机会去救你丈夫。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "休露丝",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_262_1#1$1",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "知道就好。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "休露丝",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_262_1#1$1",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "替博士警告你一句，别真的搞出人命来。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "古罗",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_260_1#2$1",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "哼，车站里都是些平民百姓，我古罗是绝不会对他们出手的。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "古罗",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_260_1#7$1",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "不过，博士，要是希瓦艾什家的人真来了——"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "古罗",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_260_1#1$1",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "我只能说，我会尽量留手。"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "极光",
          "speakerToken": "avg_422_aurora_1#8$1",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "崖心，你说你要找的......是你的登山设备？"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "恩希亚",
          "speakerToken": "avgnew_173_slchan_1#1$1",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "没错。"
