        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "极光",
          "speakerToken": "avg_422_aurora_1#2$1",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "难道说，你要攀登喀兰圣山？"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "恩希亚",
          "speakerToken": "avgnew_173_slchan_1#8$1",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "嗯......按照你说的，现在别说圣山上，圣山下肯定也有很多人了。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "恩希亚",
          "speakerToken": "avgnew_173_slchan_1#8$1",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "如果要从正面上圣山，就算是Sharp队长大概也很难潜进去。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "恩希亚",
          "speakerToken": "avgnew_173_slchan_1#1$1",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "不过这可难不倒我~"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "恩希亚",
          "speakerToken": "avgnew_173_slchan_1#1$1",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "只要能到达山脚下，剩下的交给我就好。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "极光",
          "speakerToken": "avg_422_aurora_1#4$1",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "但是......这样的话，我和其他人就不能保护你了。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "恩希亚",
          "speakerToken": "avgnew_173_slchan_1#6$1",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "没事没事。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "恩希亚",
          "speakerToken": "avgnew_173_slchan_1#6$1",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "我也在罗德岛接受过许多训练，一般的对手我还是应付得过来的。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "极光",
          "speakerToken": "avg_422_aurora_1#4$1",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "可......"
