        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "恩希亚",
          "speakerToken": "avgnew_173_slchan_1#7$1",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "切斯特叔叔，自从我爱上登山之后，我就一直想要用自己的双手爬上喀兰圣山看看。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "恩希亚",
          "speakerToken": "avgnew_173_slchan_1#7$1",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "自从姐姐成为圣女离我们而去之后，这想法就越来越强烈......总有一天，我要爬上它的顶峰，把姐姐接回家。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "恩希亚",
          "speakerToken": "avgnew_173_slchan_1#8$1",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "而现在，这个机会来了。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "切斯特",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_267_1#2$1",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "你做不到的，恩希亚。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "恩希亚",
          "speakerToken": "avgnew_173_slchan_1#8$1",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "......即使我做不到把姐姐带回家，至少在这个时候，我也要陪在姐姐身边。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "恩希亚",
          "speakerToken": "avgnew_173_slchan_1#8$1",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "老哥做了这么多的事，姐姐一定也很迷茫。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "恩希亚",
          "speakerToken": "avgnew_173_slchan_1#9$1",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "我没有办法阻止老哥，那么，至少，我要陪在姐姐的身边！"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "切斯特",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_267_1#3$1",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "......"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "narration",
          "text": "奥拉维尔，你最小的女儿，也已经长大了。"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "希瓦艾什家士官",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_286_1$1",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "二小姐，抱歉，老爷的命令是，为了您的安全着想，不允许您离开这座宅邸。"
