          "text": "不必谢我。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "切斯特",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_267_1#7$1",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "去吧，时间紧迫。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "恩希亚",
          "speakerToken": "avgnew_173_slchan_1#1$1",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "嗯！"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "切斯特",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_267_1#1$1",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "恩希亚。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "恩希亚",
          "speakerToken": "avgnew_173_slchan_1#1$1",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "嗯？"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "切斯特",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_267_1#7$1",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "注意安全。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "恩希亚",
          "speakerToken": "avgnew_173_slchan_1#10$1",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "......好！"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "切斯特",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_267_1#1$1",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "奥拉维尔。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "切斯特",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_267_1#3$1",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "在你和伊丽莎白死后，我一直后悔，过去应该支持你对领地的改革，而不是与你作对。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "切斯特",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_267_1#3$1",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "所以，当你儿子想要继承你的理想时，我选择了毫无保留地支持他。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "切斯特",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_267_1#3$1",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "恩希欧迪斯他做得很好。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "切斯特",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_267_1#3$1",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "恩雅作为圣女也得到了谢拉格人的爱戴。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "切斯特",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_267_1#3$1",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "恩希亚虽然得了矿石病，但她的病情得到了抑制，而且一如既往地开朗。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "切斯特",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_267_1#6$1",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "只是，我刚才忽然反应过来。"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "narration",
          "text": "我有多久没有见到这三个孩子聚在一起，露出兄妹之间应有的笑容了呢？"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "大长老",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_258_1#1$1",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "......"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "恩雅",
          "speakerToken": "avg_174_slbell_1#1$1",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "大长老，您应当好好休息......"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "大长老",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_258_1#1$1",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "......"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "大长老",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_258_1#1$1",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "按照记录，这座大殿，是在三族议会成立后，三族的人民共同建造的。三族人民的存在与合作要远远早于现代三族制度的建立。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "大长老",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_258_1#1$1",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "在那之后，过了上千年，中间修修补补，最终成了现在的样子。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "大长老",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_258_1#1$1",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "而这张椅子，也在这里摆了上千年。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "大长老",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_258_1#1$1",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "有十几位大长老坐在这张椅子上面，度过了他们的一生。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "恩雅",
          "speakerToken": "avg_174_slbell_1#3$1",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "......就好像，有十几位圣女，都在这座山上郁郁而终。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "大长老",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_258_1#1$1",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "从一开始，圣女就是蔓珠院为了方便信仰传播而捏造出来的。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "恩雅",
          "speakerToken": "avg_174_slbell_1#7$1",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "大长老在这个时候提及我早就知道的事实，难道是想说，信仰是虚假的？"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "大长老",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_258_1#1$1",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "你的话也直接起来了，但事情恰恰相反，恩雅，不，圣女。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "大长老",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_258_1#1$1",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "圣女，咳咳，你知道老朽的名字吗？"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "恩雅",
          "speakerToken": "avg_174_slbell_1#10$1",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "......不知道。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "大长老",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_258_1#1$1",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "这座蔓珠院中，恐怕已经没人记得了。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "大长老",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_258_1#1$1",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "就连老朽自己，都已经忘了。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "大长老",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_258_1#1$1",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "每一任的大长老，在接过上一任的衣钵之后，都会只成为大长老。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "大长老",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_258_1#1$1",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "将来，人们也会忘记你的名字，只知道你叫作圣女。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "大长老",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_258_1#1$1",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "然后，大长老和圣女都会发现——"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "大长老",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_258_1#6$1",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "人们信仰的，并非耶拉冈德。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "大长老",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_258_1#6$1",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "人们可以信仰任何东西，只要一个故事，一些巧合，他们就会信仰你，信仰我，信仰恩希欧迪斯，信仰山，信仰水，甚至信仰一片树叶。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "大长老",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_258_1#6$1",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "既然人们什么都可以信仰，那么信仰究竟是什么？"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "大长老",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_258_1#6$1",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "大长老们最终得出了答案："
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "大长老",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_258_1#6$1",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "人们信仰的，是信仰本身。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "大长老",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_258_1#2$1",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "人们将选择权交给信仰的对象。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "大长老",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_258_1#2$1",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "人们将自己排斥的事物统统归咎于信仰。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "大长老",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_258_1#2$1",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "人们无条件地信任着信仰所指导的生活方式。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "大长老",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_258_1#2$1",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "所以信仰是什么？"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "大长老",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_258_1#4$1",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "信仰是懒惰，是逃避，是颓废！信仰是安定，信仰是停滞！咳咳咳咳咳——"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "恩雅",
          "speakerToken": "avg_174_slbell_1#3$1",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "......您该休息了，大长老。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "大长老",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_258_1#4$1",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "不，圣女，圣女！"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "narration",
          "text": "大长老倏地抓住恩雅的手腕。\n力道之大，在恩雅的皮肤上都留下了红印，仿佛把他毕生的力量都用在了这上面。\n他的双眼盯着眼前的圣女，却仿佛在看着别人。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "大长老",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_258_1#6$1",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "信仰丑恶！但即使如此，没有人能够摧毁信仰！"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "大长老",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_258_1#6$1",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "谢拉格历经千年，三大家族之间隔阂渐深，却无人能够否定信仰，信仰是谢拉格之所以是谢拉格的根基！"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "大长老",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_258_1#6$1",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "信仰将谢拉格人统合在了一起，人们追求信仰，人们依赖信仰！"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "大长老",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_258_1#6$1",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "谢拉格由此存在了千年！"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "大长老",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_258_1#6$1",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "人们渴望安定，人们渴望停滞！"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "大长老",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_258_1#6$1",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "恩希欧迪斯以为他赢了，他没有，他不可能赢。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "大长老",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_258_1#6$1",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "他凭什么战胜谢拉格这千年以来凝聚而成的信仰！"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "大长老",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_258_1#6$1",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "老朽已经要不行了，但你还年轻，你是这蔓珠院的圣女，你也将成为这蔓珠院的大长老。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "大长老",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_258_1#6$1",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "去教会他，去战胜他，让他明白，信仰面前，他的那些动作不值一提！"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "narration",
          "text": "恩雅沉默片刻，却将大长老的手硬生生地从自己手腕上掰开。\n她的眼中有着对眼前老人的怜悯，更多的，却是坚决。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "恩雅",
          "speakerToken": "avg_174_slbell_1#8$1",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "......我不同意，大长老。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "恩雅",
          "speakerToken": "avg_174_slbell_1#8$1",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "您说信仰意味着停滞，人们依赖信仰，是因为他们渴望安定。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "恩雅",
          "speakerToken": "avg_174_slbell_1#8$1",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "我不这么认为。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "恩雅",
          "speakerToken": "avg_174_slbell_1#8$1",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "诚然，人一旦有所信仰，总会习惯性地依赖信仰。懒惰、逃避、颓废......您说的这些，我不否认。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "恩雅",
          "speakerToken": "avg_174_slbell_1#8$1",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "但这绝不是说，信仰意味着停滞。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "恩雅",
          "speakerToken": "avg_174_slbell_1#8$1",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "信仰就是信仰，信仰本身是没有属性的，信仰的内容是被赋予的。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "恩雅",
          "speakerToken": "avg_174_slbell_1#8$1",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "信仰向前走，信仰的人也会向前走。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "恩雅",
          "speakerToken": "avg_174_slbell_1#8$1",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "信仰停下，信仰的人也会停下。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "恩雅",
          "speakerToken": "avg_174_slbell_1#9$1",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "谢拉格的人们之所以在您的眼中向往着停滞，正是因为对耶拉冈德的信仰在蔓珠院手中停滞了千年！"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "恩雅",
          "speakerToken": "avg_174_slbell_1#9$1",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "我们遵循着某种约定俗成的规则画地为牢，在这片雪山之中生活了上千年，不去探究外面的天地，不与外面的人交流。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "恩雅",
          "speakerToken": "avg_174_slbell_1#9$1",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "然而这种约定俗成，真的和信仰有关吗？"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "恩雅",
          "speakerToken": "avg_174_slbell_1#9$1",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "这难道不是只是蔓珠院的傲慢吗？"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "大长老",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_258_1#4$1",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "傲慢？不，不，它本该如此！"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "恩雅",
          "speakerToken": "avg_174_slbell_1#1$1",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "......没有什么事本该如此。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "恩雅",
          "speakerToken": "avg_174_slbell_1#1$1",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "如果有，那它一定只是从未有所改变。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "恩雅",
          "speakerToken": "avg_174_slbell_1#8$1",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "该改变了，大长老。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "大长老",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_258_1#5$1",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "圣女，不，你改变不了什么的。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "大长老",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_258_1#5$1",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "信仰，咳咳......是谢拉格之所以是谢拉格的根基......"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "恩雅",
          "speakerToken": "avg_174_slbell_1#8$1",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "我会去和恩希欧迪斯对抗，但不是以您想要的方式。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "恩雅",
          "speakerToken": "avg_174_slbell_1#8$1",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "我也不知道我能不能成功。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "恩雅",
          "speakerToken": "avg_174_slbell_1#8$1",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "但是，圣女既然从一开始就是蔓珠院用来引导民众信仰的工具。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "恩雅",
          "speakerToken": "avg_174_slbell_1#8$1",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "那我就让这个工具真正发挥效果。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "恩雅",
          "speakerToken": "avg_174_slbell_1#8$1",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "我是圣女，但我不是蔓珠院的圣女，而是谢拉格的圣女。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "恩雅",
          "speakerToken": "avg_174_slbell_1#8$1",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "我会用我的方式去引导人民，让他们能够自由地去前进，去探究，去冒险。"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "恩雅",
          "speakerToken": "avg_174_slbell_1#3$1",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "而您，该休息了，大长老。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "恩雅",
          "speakerToken": "avg_174_slbell_1#3$1",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "来人，将大长老扶回去。"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "narration",
          "text": "恩雅站起身，头也不回地走向正殿门外。"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "narration",
          "text": "而在她的背后，大长老坐在椅子上，注视着她的背影，他伸出手，似乎想要握住什么，最终却无力地垂下。\n他什么也没有握住。\n他永远地停在了那里，一如他梦中的谢拉格雪山。"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
  "observedOperators": []
}
